anies Same goes with mutual fund also","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/muthoot-finance/1614/335","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-08-06T04:40:44.106Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-04T06:14:25.589Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-648009","source":"valuepickr","author":"maheshkumar","handle":"@maheshkumar","community":"Muthoot Finance","timestamp":"2026-08-05T11:45:34.579Z","text":"But small caps have inherent risk while these cash cows are long term compounders and wealth creators","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/muthoot-finance/1614/334","sentiment":"bullish","likes":0,"comments":1,"firstSeenAt":"2026-08-05T15:36:38.544Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-04T06:14:25.589Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-647987","source":"valuepickr","author":"Shreyansh_Chandrakar","handle":"@Shreyansh_Chandrakar","community":"Muthoot Finance","timestamp":"2026-08-05T06:14:01.375Z","text":"Correct but if the growth rate doesn’t increase too much because stock already been into large cap so can’t keep much expectations That’s why big investor look for mid and small cap mainly","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/muthoot-finance/1614/333","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-08-05T15:36:38.544Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-03T17:05:30.587Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-647983","source":"valuepickr","author":"maheshkumar","handle":"@maheshkumar","community":"Muthoot Finance","timestamp":"2026-08-05T05:49:06.223Z","text":"Market keep correcting muthoot and Manappuram thinking they will stop growing and competition will eat their pie But both keep growing for decades And then after some time they will again go up. It keeps happening in cycles the Correct then they go up then the Correct and then they go up but if you see a long-term chart it’s a pretty smooth chart. Make a lot of money if you buy it at every correction.","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/muthoot-finance/1614/332","sentiment":"bullish","likes":1,"comments":1,"firstSeenAt":"2026-08-05T15:36:38.544Z","last